  ----------------- ---------------------------- ------------- ----------------------------- ------------- ------------
  Phi (Nano)        `tt_um_trinity_nano`         TT #4914      1$\times$`<!-- -->`{=html}1   51            `0xCF`
  Euler (Compact)   `tt_um_ghtag_trinity_gf16`   TT #4915      8$\times$`<!-- -->`{=html}2   90            `0xAE`
  Gamma (Full)      `tt_um_trinity_max_true`     TT #4913      8$\times$`<!-- -->`{=html}4   105           `0x93`

